## API Response Format (Updated)

### Single Prediction
```json
{
  "prediction": "ATTACK",
  "confidence": 1.0,
  "attack_type": "DDoS",
  "attack_type_confidence": 1.0,
  "model": "two_stage_pipeline"
}
```

### Bulk Response Summary
```json
{
  "total_flows": 1000,
  "attack_count": 579,
  "benign_count": 421,
  "attack_percentage": 57.9,
  "attack_type_counts": {"DDoS": 579}
}
```

